(  Sikui \(Deer\) na Machun \(Crab\)-li racing-li challenge sakda, 'Nakhurli pa) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(  Machunna clever-laka da Sikuiwui kachei-li khangarom-da finish line-li a) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(  Kacham-kacham mibingna speed-wui matuida clever strategy kala patience-n) Tj
