(English Translation & Literary Rendering:) Tj
0 -14 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(  The swift Deer \(*Sikui*\) challenged the slow Crab \(*Machun*\) to a race, ) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(  Yet the astute crab clung discreetly to the deer's tail, tumbling forwar) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(  Thus children learn that unbridled pride is outmatched by clever foresig) Tj
0 -13 Td
